msgctxt "64"
msgid "The guy who's always with Rikiya is Mikio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"From what I understand, he joined the Ryudo Family because he looked up to "
"both Rikiya and Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"But he's still wet behind the ears, so to speak, so he's not really a "
"full-fledged yakuza yet. Still, folks around here love him⑬feed him every "
"time he comes to collect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "You ever hear of a yakuza getting along with townspeople like that?"
msgstr ""

